# Per-test plusargs for byte_lane_indexed_mmu_irq_storm.
#
# IRQ storm — inject at many cycles spanning the 16x outer-loop run.
# Cycles chosen to hit different points: store-buffer-drain windows,
# cracked-uop-mid-EA-compute, cmpb/notb RMW boundaries.
#
# Per-iter the inner dbf loop runs ~50 cycles, outer loop runs 16x →
# total ~800 cycles for the test body.  We inject at 300, 350, 400,
# 450, 500, 550, 600, 700, 800, 900 — fine-grained sweep.
+ipl=300:1
+ipl=350:1
+ipl=400:1
+ipl=450:1
+ipl=500:1
+ipl=550:1
+ipl=600:1
+ipl=700:1
+ipl=800:1
+ipl=900:1
+ipl=1000:1
+ipl=1100:1
+ipl=1200:1
+ipl=1300:1
+ipl=1400:1
+ipl=1500:1
